The Wilson score interval formula is:
$$\frac{\hat{p} + \frac{z^2}{2n} \pm z\sqrt{\frac{\hat{p}(1-\hat{p})}{n} + \frac{z^2}{4n^2}}}{1 + \frac{z^2}{n}}$$

The midpoint `(mid)` was correctly divided by `den`, but the half-width (`half`) was not. This made every interval wider — for 5/10 it produced ~[0.14, 0.86] instead of the correct ~[0.24, 0.76].

**The Fix (line 54)**
```go
half := z*math.Sqrt(p*(1-p)/n+z2/(4*n*n)) / den   // ← now divided by den
return math.Max(0, mid-half), math.Min(1, mid+half)
```

